'''Alkhara's spire''' was a tower that was part of [[Boba Fett's Palace]].<ref name="EncyTatooine">{{EncyclopediaCite|Tatooine}}</ref> It was named after the criminal [[Alkhara]], who owned the palace before [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba the Hutt]].<ref name="CL" />

